/* RemoteCommand+Mac.swift */
"iTerm2 can use AI to check the safety of commands suggested by your AI agent. Would you like to enable safety checking?\n\nWhen enabled, each proposed command will be sent to your configured AI provider for a safety check." = "iTerm2 可以使用 AI 檢查您的 AI 智慧體建議的命令的安全性。是否要啟用安全檢查？\n\n啟用後，每個擬執行的命令將傳送給您配置的 AI 提供商進行安全檢查。";
"Until now, iTerm2 checked the safety of AI-suggested commands on your Mac using Apple Intelligence, at no cost. It can now use your configured AI model instead, which is more accurate but sends each checked command to your AI provider and may incur charges.\n\nSwitch to your configured model? If you decline, iTerm2 keeps using Apple Intelligence." = "迄今為止，iTerm2 使用 Apple Intelligence 在您的 Mac 上免費檢查 AI 建議命令的安全性。現在它可以改用您配置的 AI 模型，更準確但會將每個檢查的命令傳送給您的 AI 提供商，可能會產生費用。\n\n是否切換到您配置的模型？如果拒絕，iTerm2 將繼續使用 Apple Intelligence。";

