"Return no more than %@ lines. You may return fewer or none rather than poor quality suggestions." = "返回不超過 %@ 行。您可以返回更少或不返回，而不是返回低質量的建議。";
"The current working directory is %@" = "當前工作目錄是 %@";
"The user appears to be entering the name of a command to execute, not one of its arguments, so completions should be for executable commands likely to be present on the system." = "使用者似乎正在輸入要執行的命令名稱，而不是其引數，因此補全應該是系統上可能存在的可執行命令。";
"The suggestion in each line you respond with is a candidate to append after what has been typed so far." = "您回覆的每一行中的建議都是在已輸入內容之後追加的候選。";
"Previously run commands in chronological order are:" = "按時間順序排列的先前執行的命令是：";
"(end of command list)" = "（命令列表結束）";
"Your suggestions should take recently run commands into consideration: if possible, suggest a command that builds on what the user has begun." = "您的建議應考慮最近執行的命令：如果可能，建議一個基於使用者已開始輸入的命令。";
"Do not make up or invent file or directory names." = "不要編造或虛構檔案或目錄名稱。";
"If a suggestion would end with a filename, use %@ instead." = "如果建議以檔名結尾，請改用 %@。";
"Do not invent other kinds of placeholders such as {{MESSAGE}} or {{DIRECTORY}}. Use plain English, like \"message\", instead." = "不要發明其他型別的佔位符，如 {{MESSAGE}} 或 {{DIRECTORY}}。請使用普通英文，如 \"message\"。";
"Instead, your suggestion may end with the longest common prefix of valid filename completions, which is: %@" = "相反，您的建議可以以有效檔名補全的最長公共字首結尾，即：%@";
"The text the user has entered so far, which needs completion, is:" = "使用者到目前為止輸入的需要補全的文本是：";
"Additionally, there is some text after the cursor. Use this to come up with better suggestions, assuming it will be used after what you suggest or that your suggestion will replace some of it. It is:" = "此外，游標後面有一些文本。請利用這些文本提出更好的建議，假設它將在您建議的內容之後使用，或者您的建議將替換其中一部分。它是：";

/* AIExplanationRequest.swift */
"After this paragraph I will attach the output of %@, which the user needs help understanding." = "在此段落之後，我將附加 %@ 的輸出，使用者需要幫助理解。";
"After this paragraph I will attach some text from a terminal emulator that the user needs help understanding." = "在此段落之後，我將附加來自終端機模擬器的一些文本，使用者需要幫助理解。";
"The beginning of the command output is not included because it was extremely long. What you see is just the latter part of it." = "命令輸出的開頭未包含在內，因為它非常長。您看到的只是它的後半部分。";
"Annotations should explain parts of the output that the user likely wants to know more about, such as error messages, abstruse terms of art, tersely formatted messages, or anything non-obvious." = "註釋應解釋使用者可能想了解更多關於輸出的部分，例如錯誤訊息、深奧的術語、簡潔格式的訊息或任何不明顯的內容。";
"Respond with a sequence of annotations." = "用一系列註釋來回復。";
"Since the user asked for this to be explained, you should always add at least one annotation." = "由於使用者要求解釋此內容，您應始終新增至少一個註釋。";
"You should respond to their question with a main response and, if needed, annotations of the text provided below." = "您應該用主要回復來回答他們的問題，如果需要，還可以對下面提供的文本進行註釋。";
"The entirety of the main response should be wrapped in <response>…</response> tags." = "主要回復的全部內容應包裹在 <response>…</response> 標籤中。";
"The main response should be markdown. < and & must be ampersand encoded." = "主要回復應為 markdown 格式。< 和 & 必須使用 & 編碼。";
"You may also choose to include annotations that are relevant to the question." = "您也可以選擇包含與問題相關的註釋。";
"Annotations will be displayed to the user next to the parts of the terminal emulator's content." = "註釋將在終端機模擬器內容的部分旁邊顯示給使用者。";
"Don't annotate anything obvious, like self-explanatory comments in code." = "不要註釋任何明顯的內容，如程式碼中不言自明的註釋。";
"Never use a substring as its own annotation." = "永遠不要使用子字串作為自己的註釋。";
"An example of a good annotation: `Error: text file busy` might be annotated as `This usually happens when you try to modify or delete an executable that is currently running`." = "一個好註釋的例子：`Error: text file busy` 可以註釋為 `當您嘗試修改或刪除當前正在執行的執行檔時，通常會發生這種情況`。";
"Use ampersand escaping like HTML if you need to use a quotation mark or an ampersand." = "如果您需要使用引號或 & 符號，請使用類似 HTML 的 & 跳脫。";
"You may provide more than one annotation per line of input if needed." = "如果需要，您可以為每行輸入提供多個註釋。";
"Avoid overlapping annotations because they lead to a confusing user interface." = "避免重疊註釋，因為它們會導致混亂的使用者介面。";
