"Upload of %@ finished." = "上傳 %@ 完成。";
"Uploading…" = "正在上傳…";
"User declined to enable orchestration." = "使用者拒絕啟用編排。";
"Workgroup: %@" = "工作群組:%@";
"Would you like to grant AI **%@** permission?" = "是否授予 AI **%@** 權限?";
"[Attached file]" = "[附件檔案]";
"cancelled" = "已取消";
"iTerm2 can include this session’s visible screen and terminal state with every message you send in AI chats where you’ve allowed it, so the assistant sees what you see. You can turn this off any time from a chat’s permission settings." = "在你允許的 AI 對話中,iTerm2 可以在你傳送每則訊息時附帶此工作階段的可見螢幕與終端機狀態,讓助理看到你所看到的。你可以隨時在對話的權限設定中關閉此功能。";
"⚠️ **The AI safety check flagged this command as potentially dangerous. Review it with care.**\n\n" = "⚠️ **AI 安全檢查標記此命令可能有危險。請謹慎檢視。**\n\n";
"🛑 The text to analyze was too long. Select a portion of it and try again." = "🛑 要分析的文字過長。請選擇其中一部分後重試。";
"After the tab, the suggestion should begin with the literal text the user has entered so far." = "定位鍵之後,建議應以使用者目前已輸入的字面文字開頭。";
"I am logged in as %@@%@" = "我以 %@@%@ 登入";
"I executed the following command line:" = "我執行了以下命令列:";
"It produced this output:" = "它產生了以下輸出:";
"My current directory was:" = "我目前的工作目錄是:";
"Note: iTerm2 already sent a push notification to the user's iPhone for this event. Do not send another." = "註:iTerm2 已就此事向使用者的 iPhone 傳送了推播通知。請勿再傳。";
"Note: the user asked for a push notification but notifications are unavailable right now, so make sure they see this in chat." = "註:使用者要求推播通知,但目前通知不可用,請確保使用者在對話中看到此訊息。";
"Note: the user may be away from their Mac. If they asked to be told when this happened, also send a push notification with the notify tool." = "註:使用者可能不在 Mac 前。如果使用者要求在發生此事時被告知,請同時用 notify 工具傳送推播通知。";
"Streaming not supported in the objective C interface" = "Objective-C 介面不支援串流傳輸";
"The current hostname is %@" = "目前主機名稱是 %@";
"The exit status of the command was %@" = "命令的退出狀態是 %@";
"The user has asked this question about it: “%@”" = "使用者就此提出了這個問題:「%@」";
"iTerm2 is sending you this message automatically because the user enabled sending terminal commands to AI for assistance. If you can provide useful non-obvious insights, respond with those. Do not restate information that is obvious from the output. If there is nothing important to say, just respond with \"Got it.\"" = "iTerm2 自動向你傳送這則訊息,是因為使用者開啟了將終端機命令傳送給 AI 尋求協助的功能。如果你能提供有用的非顯而易見的見解,請回覆這些見解。不要複述從輸出中顯而易見的資訊。如果沒有重要的內容要說,只需回覆 \"Got it.\"。";
"Unknown backslash escape “%@”. Recognized: \\\\, \\n, \\r, \\t, \\uXXXX." = "未知反斜線跳脫「%@」。支援的跳脫:\\\\、\\n、\\r、\\t、\\uXXXX。";
"Truncated \\\\uXXXX escape (needs exactly four hex digits)." = "\\uXXXX 跳脫被截斷(需要恰好四位十六進位數字)。";
"For example, if the command so far was `git re` then you might suggest `Rewrite commit history\\tgit rebase`, `Rewrite commit history\\tgit revert`, and `Move branch pointer\\tgit reset`. " = "例如,若目前已輸入的命令是 `git re`,你可以建議 `Rewrite commit history\\tgit rebase`、`Rewrite commit history\\tgit revert` 和 `Move branch pointer\\tgit reset`。 ";
"You can suggest more than one additional word when you can tell from context that it would be a good suggestion. For example, if the user frequently runs `grep ERROR <file> | sort | uniq` and you see that the text so far is `grep ERROR myfile.txt` your response could include `Count unique errors\\tgrep ERROR myfile.txt | sort | uniq`" = "當你能從上下文判斷出會是好的建議時,可以建議多個補充詞。例如,若使用者經常執行 `grep ERROR <file> | sort | uniq` 而你看到已輸入的文字是 `grep ERROR myfile.txt`,你的回應可以包含 `Count unique errors\\tgrep ERROR myfile.txt | sort | uniq`";
"server" = "伺服器";
"There is no registered function by that name. Try again." = "沒有按該名稱註冊的函數。請重試。";
"This message requires a newer version of iTerm2 to view." = "檢視此訊息需要更新版本的 iTerm2。";
"The request violated Gemini's safety rules." = "該請求違反了 Gemini 的安全規則。";
"While parsing a function call request" = "解析函式呼叫請求時";
"I have attached files for you to use.\n" = "我已附上檔案供你使用。\n";
"I was unable to complete the function call: " = "我未能完成此函式呼叫：";
"If a zip file is provided (this is rare), you should extract it and analyze the contents in the context of the accompanying messages." = "如果提供了 zip 檔案（這種情況很少見），你應將其解壓縮並結合隨附訊息的內容進行分析。";
"AI token limit exceeded because the conversation reached its maximum length" = "對話長度達到上限，超出 AI token 限制。";
"Write to the Clipboard" = "寫入剪貼簿";
"Write to the File System" = "寫入檔案系統";
"Act in Web Browser" = "在 Web 瀏覽器中操作";

"[iTerm2 was restarted before this tool call completed. The call did not finish; assume no side effects took place and re-issue if needed.]" = "[iTerm2 在此函式呼叫完成前被重新啟動。呼叫未完成；可假定未產生任何副作用，如有需要請重新發起。]";
"Check Terminal State" = "檢查終端機狀態";
"Run Commands" = "執行命令";
"View Contents" = "檢視內容";
"Control Terminal" = "控制終端機";
"View Manpages" = "檢視手冊頁";